orting period totals each product type will broken down category c then sector i mining infrastructure oil gas power others region i americas europe middle east africa asia pacific country designation i designated country non designated country whether independent review been carried out data project finance transactions project related corporate loans shown separately project related refinance project related acquisition finance epfi will report total number s refinance acquisition finance transactions reached financial close during reporting period totals each product type will broken down sector i mining infrastructure oil gas power others region i americas europe middle east africa asia pacific country designation i designated country non designated country case project related refinance project related acquisition finance project finance transactions epfi will follow project name reporting project finance described below bridge loans data data bridge loans due nature are not subject specific reporting requirements implementation reporting epfi will report its implementation equator principles including mandate equator principles reviewers responsibilities staffing respective roles equator principles reviewers business lines senior management transaction review process incorporation equator principles its credit risk management policies procedures first year equator principles adoption epfi will provide details its internal preparation staff training after first year epfi provide details ongoing training staff if considered relevant project name reporting project finance including relevant refinanc acquisition finance epfi will submit project name data directly equator principles association secretariat publication equator principles association project name reporting required project finance transaction s have reached financial close encouraged project related corporate loans have reached financial close subject obtaining client consent subject applicable local