isclosure intensity ratios can provided others organization specific metrics denominators can include reporting organization can report intensity ratio direct scope energy indirect scope ghg emissions combined using figures reported disclosures background intensity ratios define ghg emissions context organization specific metric many organizations track environmental performance intensity ratios which are often called normalized environmental impact data ghg emissions intensity expresses amount ghg emissions per unit activity output any other organization specific metric combination organization’s absolute ghg emissions reported disclosures ghg emissions intensity helps contextualize organization’s efficiency including relation other organizations references bibliography guidance products such metric tons co emissions per unit produced 2• services such metric tons co emissions per function per service 2• sales such metric tons co emissions per sales 2• units product production volume such metric tons liters mwh size such m floor space 2• number full time employees monetary units such revenue sales gri emissions disclosure reduction ghg emissions reporting organization report following information compilation requirements requirements ghg emissions reduced direct result reduction initiatives metric tons co2 equivalent gases included calculation whether co ch n o hfcs pfcs sf nf all 3b base year baseline including rationale choosing it c scopes which reductions took place whether direct scope energy indirect scope other indirect scope d standards methodologies assumptions calculation tools used when compiling information specified disclosure reporting organization exclude reductions resulting reduced production capacity outsourcing use inventory project method account reductions calculate initiative’s total reductions ghg emissions sum its associated primary effects any significant secondary effects if reporting two more scope types report reductions each separately r